  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="3c94db6e-ed98-5399-be54-3be24bfc91a4" activityNameId="2bf379f4-082e-516d-b5b9-096198f1f0fb" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Operation, freight train</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Operation, freight train
Average data for the operation of goods transportation by rail in Switzerland. The data has been determined top down, by combining the total yearly energy consumption and the yearly tkm-performance of goods transportation.;
UUID: bb2a9d50-f060-36a5-b99b-6d15bccd1e8b
The inventory includes the actual energy consumption for an average goods train (869Gt) in Switzerland using electro and diesel energy. In addition the diesel consumption and emissions of shunting processes are accounted for.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: electric traction, diesel traction for shunting processes, average share of particle filters
Time period: Data for emission indices for shunting  is based on figures of 1995, specific energy consumption per tkm is from 2006
Production volume: 10786 Mio. tkm in 2007  in Switzerland
Sampling: International  Railway statistic 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bb2a9d50-f060-36a5-b99b-6d15bccd1e8b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
